# Development Workflow & Build Process

## 🚀 Quick Start Commands

### Initial Setup

```shell
git clone https://github.com/dkrizhanovskyi/nim-blockchain-node.git
cd nim-blockchain-node
nimble install
```

### Build & Run

```shell
nimble buildAll       # Compiles main.exe and blockchain_cli.exe with release optimizations
nimble build          # Compiles main.exe
./blockchain_cli.exe  # Run the blockchain CLI
./main.exe            # Run the blockchain node
nimble test           # Run all unit and integration test suites
```

## 📁 Project Structure Overview

```
nim-blockchain-node/
├── src/                    # Source code organized by architectural layers
│   ├── common/             # Canonical domain types, config, results, logsetup
│   ├── core_engine/        # Consensus, state management, VM
│   ├── cryptography/       # Key management, keystore, signature verification, ZK proofs  
│   ├── network/            # P2P, mempool, block propagation
│   ├── storage/            # BlockchainStore, IndexStore, AccountStore facades & backends
│   ├── cli/                # Decomposed CLI: parser, handlers, service context
│   ├── node.nim            # Shared composition root (BlockchainNode)
│   ├── cli.nim             # CLI facade & legacy test adapters
│   ├── blockchain_cli.nim  # CLI executable entry point
│   └── main.nim            # Node executable entry point
├── tests/                  # Unit and integration test suites
│   ├── unit_tests/         # Core engine, crypto, network, storage, and CLI tests
│   └── integration_tests/  # End-to-end node and lifecycle integration tests
├── docs/                   # Architecture, overview, setup docs, and ADRs (001-008)
└── nim_blockchain_node.nimble  # Build configuration and task runners
```

## ⚙️ Build Configuration

The [nim_blockchain_node.nimble](mdc:nim_blockchain_node.nimble) file defines:

- **buildAll task**: Compiles both `main.nim` and `blockchain_cli.nim` with release optimizations
- **build task**: Compiles `main.nim` with release optimizations
- **test task**: Compiles and executes all unit and integration test suites sequentially
- **Dependencies**: Pinned `nimcrypto == 0.6.2` for cryptographic primitives

